18. GNU C Library 2.41, iconv (https://www.gnu.org/software/libc/)
    Licence R (LGPL-2.1-or-later). Copyright (C) 1997-2025 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
    - src/iconv.rs, src/iconv/*.rs: the conversion driver (iconv/skeleton.c, loop.c, gconv_simple.c,
      gconv_trans.c, gconv_charset.c) and the charset modules (iconvdata/*.c) are followed closely to reproduce
      glibc's behaviour.
    - Data measured from glibc's iconv() and locale data in the oracle image rather than copied from glibc's
      sources: the charset tables, names and aliases and the transliteration table of the C.UTF-8 locale
      (translit_neutral and translit_combining) (src/iconv_tables.rs, src/iconv/cjk_tables.rs,
      src/iconv/data/*.bin; the *.gen.php scripts next to them generate them).


